&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please do hurry with the transfer, I&#039;m stretched a bit thin and can&#039;t afford to have my assistant waste time pretending to be friends with this thing. I&#039;ve told him to drop the act moving forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dr. J. Everwood&lt;br /&gt;
GoI-466 Research Lead&lt;br /&gt;
Secure, Contain, Protect&lt;/p&gt;
